From: ajensenwaud <ajensenwaud@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 15:17:34 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 55/60] Muse Spark: TF_MUSE_FAST as lever bits (qkvg, router,
 cluster, 32-row passes, 32-member expert tiles); kv8 int8 (default,
 TF_MUSE_KV8=1) or e4m3 (=2); tf-muse timing arms, expert-window sweep and
 prompt phase profile

